  "title": "Nourishing Dense Norwegian Corned Beef Hash",
  "description": "A dense and flavorful Norwegian dish featuring corned beef, score-fat, and vegetables, cooked in a bamboo steamer. This meal is perfect for a hearty breakfast or brunch.",
