      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": "chopped"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "In a large bowl, combine the diced corned beef, melted score-fat, diced onions, grated carrots, and diced potatoes.",
    "Season the mixture with salt and black pepper.",
    "Stir in the chopped fresh parsley.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a bamboo steamer lined with parchment paper.",
    "Steam the mixture over boiling water for 20 minutes.",
    "Check the hash for doneness and steam for an additional 5 minutes if necessary.",
    "Remove the hash from the steamer and let it cool for a few minutes.",
    "Serve the hash hot, garnished with additional parsley if desired."
